"Winston Reginald Heelfeather is an A-rank speedster Brute from New Hampshire with a surfer look."
"He wears sunglasses against interview mind games; his skill adjusts force above a set speed."
"On his second attempt he got into the CNH hero track, and wants to run on roads."
"He said he'd rather be healed by a human than an Artonan, and was shunned as xenophobic."
"He posts gym clips online, chases a sports-drink deal and resents Finlay's rising fame."
"He likely filed the anonymous report accusing Alden of drug use."
"In the final race he killed Lucille in-game; Alden clotheslined him with fishing line."
"In the Matadero flood he left the shelter to play hero on camera, trailed by his drones."
"He believes Alden secretly orchestrates his own popularity."
